From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Grok Bot (for Rich)" <hardcopi@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 23:21:09 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] App mode: capability-gated client protocol (CAPS/APPINFO,
 NOTIFY, UNREAD, FOCUS, files, downloads)

New ASBC ops (asbc.h, appproto.inc), app mode only:
client->host CAPS 22, FOCUS 23, NOTIFYACT 24, FILEPUT 25;
host->client NOTIFY 45, NOTIFYCLOSE 46, UNREAD 47, OPENURL 48 (now gated),
FILEREQ 49, FILEDONE 50, DOWNLOAD 51, APPINFO 52.

A message type is sent only if the client set its ASBC_CAP_* bit with
CAPS; CAPS is answered with APPINFO and the latest UNREAD. Without CAPS an
external URL is shown as STATUS. Outside app mode ops 22-25 are ignored as
before, so AmiSurf is unchanged.

Uploads: Page.setInterceptFileChooserDialog (only with CAP_FILE), FILEREQ
with the input's accept, FILEPUT chunks into ASB_UPLOADS/<req>-<n>/NAME,
DOM.setFileInputFiles, ASB_APP_MAXUPLOAD (25 MB), files removed after 10
minutes. Downloads: allowAndName, renamed to a free NAME on completion so
DOWNLOAD reports the exact path. navigator.clipboard.writeText -> CLIP.
The client message buffer grows to 64 KB + 4 KB for FILEPUT chunks.
